edits.oldText:
/// Returns whether [path]'s row is currently built inside the visible
/// viewport.
///
/// When the browser is unmounted (or before its first layout), this
/// pessimistically reports `true` to avoid exposing an action before we can
/// reliably measure.
bool isTrackInView(String path) => _isTrackInView?.call(path) ?? true;

edits.newText:
/// Returns whether [path]'s row is currently built inside the visible
/// viewport.
///
/// When the browser is unmounted (or before its first layout), we treat the
/// row as not-in-view so Linux can still offer the “bring into view”
/// action immediately.
bool isTrackInView(String path) => _isTrackInView?.call(path) ?? false;

